# Klondike #1 won through the mouse: host/klsolve.c's solution
# (test/klondike1.moves) as drags, double clicks (home) and clicks on the
# talon; the win's cards, a click, the win box
game 0 1
shot kwdrag
moves test/klondike1.moves
state
wait 200
shotnow kwinanim
wait 60
click 320 300
wait 90
end 30
